  "id": "ahu-economizer",
  "name": "AHU Economizer Monitoring",
  "description": "OAT, RAT, MAT, SAT, OA damper command and supply fan status: data freshness, mixed air outside the OAT-RAT range by more than 2 °F for 300 s while the fan runs, OA damper open above 10 % with the fan off for 300 s, and SAT - MAT. Monitoring only.",
